================================================================================
Third-party source embedded in this distribution
================================================================================

This repository's benchmark corpora embed source excerpts from FSL
(https://github.com/ymm-oss/fsl), an unrelated public repository, used as
review targets for measuring ReviewGraphen's behavior against real,
unmodified code. FSL is also authored and copyrighted by Ryoichi Izumita
and is licensed Apache License, Version 2.0 (confirmed directly against
FSL's own LICENSE and NOTICE files, not assumed). Per Apache-2.0 Section
4, the original copyright and license headers are preserved verbatim in
every embedded file; this NOTICE section carries forward FSL's own
attribution per Section 4(d).

Locations and scope, as of 2026-08-18:

  benchmarks/m7-real-v1/public/snapshot-*/snapshot/rust/...
    80 full, unmodified file copies (~19 MB total) across 41 snapshot
    directories, extracted via `git show` at specific FSL commits.
    16 distinct file paths, spanning the fsl-core, fsl-runtime,
    fsl-syntax, fsl-tools, fsl-wasm, and fslc crates:
      rust/fsl-core/src/dialect.rs
      rust/fsl-core/src/domain.rs
      rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs
      rust/fsl-core/src/lib.rs
      rust/fsl-core/src/model.rs
      rust/fsl-runtime/src/explicit.rs
      rust/fsl-runtime/src/lib.rs
      rust/fsl-syntax/src/ai_project.rs
      rust/fsl-syntax/src/lib.rs
      rust/fsl-tools/src/domain.rs
      rust/fsl-wasm/src/lib.rs
      rust/fslc/src/frontend_output.rs
      rust/fslc/src/lib.rs
      rust/fslc/src/main.rs
      rust/fslc/src/outcome.rs
      rust/fslc/src/verification.rs
    Each file retains its own `// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0`
    and `// Copyright 2026 Ryoichi Izumita` header unmodified.

  benchmarks/m7-head-v1/private/calibration/generation/calibration-*/
    20 model-generated "fix proposal" records in unified-diff format;
    each diff's context lines quote a small number of real lines of FSL
    source (primarily rust/fslc/src/main.rs) as patch context. Smaller
    in scale and character than the full-file copies above — excerpts
    within a diff, not file copies.

Why this is included: ReviewGraphen's m7-* benchmark family measures
review-obligation synthesis and detection against real, previously
unmodified source, not synthetic fixtures alone. FSL was chosen as the
real-code corpus because its full commit history was available and its
license permits this reproduction. No FSL source outside the two
locations above is embedded anywhere in this repository (verified by a
repository-wide search for FSL's copyright header before this NOTICE was
written).

FSL's own third-party runtime dependencies (lark, MIT License; z3-solver,
MIT License — see https://github.com/lark-parser/lark and
https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3) are not themselves embedded in this
repository in any form; they are named here only because FSL's own
NOTICE file names them, and Apache-2.0 Section 4(d) asks that a carried
NOTICE remain readable, not that it be edited down.
